    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages a stack of scenes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classSceneManager" kindref="compound">SceneManager</ref> handles scene transitions by maintaining a stack of scenes. Only the top scene is active (receives Update and Render calls).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Supports pushing, popping, and setting scenes. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classScene" kindref="compound">Scene</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
